# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
bin/
obj/
target/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- ROMs
# Never commit ROMs or ROM-derived assets. CI enforces this (see .github/workflows/ci.yml).
*.nes
*.smd
*.gen
*.32x
*.sms
*.gg
*.sfc
*.fig
*.swc
*.rom
*.bin
*.zip

# A top-level Markdown file is treated as a potential Sonic 2 ROM (the stock ROM is a .md
# binary). Only real documentation is allowed through.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- derived data
# Extracted ROM data, build caches and generated game archives.
**/extracted/
**/*.work/
**/data.bin
**/sonicbros3.bin
**/web-data/
**/web/runtime/
**/trainer-runs/
**/disasm/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- tooling
node_modules/
coverage/
.env
